🔖 637 interactive modules on ML and AI

On VizLearn, you can visually explore:
🫡 Gradient descent;
🫡 SVM and PCA;
🫡 Bayes' theorem;
🫡 BPE tokenization;
🫡 Query, Key, and Value;
🫡 KV cache;
🫡 Quantization;
🫡 Neural networks and LLMs.

Change the input data and immediately see the results of the calculations.

